/* The Time Travellers – MiniMystery Education (history, groep 5–8 / ages 6–12). Texts and missions (EN).
   The school clock turns out to be a time machine. At places around (or inside) the school there are "time leaks": at each leak the team looks into an era,
   does a small investigation in their own neighbourhood and answers a question. Reward: a time key (the era). In the finale they put the
   eras in order: then time is repaired and the clock comes back.
   The ten eras are those of the Dutch canon (groep 5–8). Three levels: 0 = ages 6–7, 1 = 8–9, 2 = 10–12.
   Per mission: intro (the time journey), feit (the learning moment, after the answer), act {out,in} (investigation outside / inside the building),
   lvl[3] = question (text/choice), spoor = examples of traces from that era in a neighbourhood (for the neighbourhood investigation). */
